'''Reptavians''' were [[Species|creatures]] that exhibited both [[Reptile|reptilian]] and [[Bird|avian]] traits. They were swift creatures, most of which were large enough to ride. Notable examples included the [[shriek-hawk]], [[kaadu]], [[ruping]], [[varactyl]], [[pikobi]], [[bogwing]], [[brezak]] and [[dactillion]].<ref name="EV">''[[Star Wars: The Visual Encyclopedia]]''</ref>

